          "text" : "Update EPA.EPA.[EPA_DRG-V_XML_Letter_Gen_Log]\nSet Resend = 0\nWhere LogID IN (Select l1.LogID \n\tFrom EPA.EPA.[EPA_DRG-V_XML_Letter_Gen_Log] l1\n\tInner Join EPA.EPA.[EPA_DRG-V_XML_Letter_Gen_Log] l2 On l1.ClaimID = l2.ClaimID And l1.NPI = l2.NPI and l1.Tax_ID = l2.Tax_ID\n\tWhere Format(l2.GenerateDate,'yyyy-MM-dd') = Format(GetDate(),'yyyy-MM-dd')\n\tAnd l1.Resend = 1\n\t)\n"
